	bool "External, driver in the board code"
	help
	  An external MAC, e.g. ENC28J60 / LAN9250 on SPI: the board code
	  implements umcub_port_eth_* (port/include/umcub_port_eth.h, raw frames),
	  the IPv4 / DHCP stack runs on top of it.
