	prompt "UART"
	depends on TRANSPORT_UART
	default UART_LINK_PLAIN
	help
	  plain: SMP and text as they are, one device on the line. addressed: only
	  umcub link frames (node address, discovery, standard SMP inside); on the
	  host the umcub tool, which also serves mcumgr / smpmgr. secure:
	  addressed, and a host must authenticate before anything runs, a MAC on
	  every frame. docs/link.md.
