	bool "Secure link needs readout protection"
	depends on LINK_SECURE
	default y
	help
	  Keep secure transports closed while flash readout protection is off (RDP
	  level 0: the device key can be read with a debugger). Off only for
	  development.
config LINK_SESSION_MS
	int "Session timeout (ms)"
	depends on LINK_SECURE
	default 60000
	help
	  A session ends after this long without a valid frame.

